    "body": "It is possible to store some models with dill https://pypi.org/project/dill/. There is a problem to load models with SLSQP optimizer because of package symengine (since this package is only optional in Windows, it is possible to load models there). Still, it would be nice to have a class method, which allows an official way how to store it without trying several packages.",
